          "method": [
            "Brown the mince, then add onion and garlic until soft.",
            "Stir in tomatoes and pur\u00e9e; simmer 30 minutes.",
            "Make a roux with butter and flour, whisk in milk to a smooth b\u00e9chamel.",
            "Layer rag\u00f9, pasta sheets and b\u00e9chamel, repeating to fill the dish.",
