            "Simmer rag\u00f9 30 min minimum until thick \u2014 sauce should coat the back of a spoon.",
            "B\u00e9chamel: whisk constantly; pass through sieve if lumpy. Season with nutmeg.",
            "Layer in GN tray: rag\u00f9 \u2192 pasta \u2192 b\u00e9chamel \u00d7 3. Top with parmesan.",
